Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.61,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(249,38.25)}Baby Elephant Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.61,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs20\pos(241.337,359.333)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My canary pet, Piko-{\i1}chan{\i0}, was very agitated, so I decided to check in our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I saw our gas stove had gas leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have been very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.17,0:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it could have burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but our lives were saved thanks to my Piko-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, our dog Mook once caught a robber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My Mook is a very reliable dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Persian cat once retrieved my mum's lost ruby ring worth {\fnCalibri}¥1,000,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.03,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Animals are so lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They love you back with interest added, if you love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I too want an pet animal to catch robber and warn me about gas leakage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to surprise all by buying an exquisite animal like a Lion or an Elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Be reasonable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know that your mum don't like any animals, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll come up with something, if it's for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger Robot from the future, Doraemon-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flattering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild Pet House!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get animals using this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a green plain over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:01:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so vast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.63,0:02:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an African Savanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems little different than an Anywhere Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lion! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We are saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying now? You wanted to get a lion then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna! No need Lion anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna get some other animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn the dial around, you may find the animal you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Giraffe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A Hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! An elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn the dial around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.45,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby Elephant! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope it's not abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Usually, baby Elephants are surrounded by their mother and Elephants in their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were shot by the poachers, and got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it's mother is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This baby Elephant looks not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be hungry, it needs milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, gimme milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.65,0:04:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to get a glass of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it doesn't like a cow's milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.34,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll die if it doesn't drink it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try feeding it the Momotaro Dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, for-all animal food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It started drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy, Young Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tickling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still up, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be late for school if you don't fall asleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Doraemon. I wonder how's Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} doing and what if it went somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.89,0:05:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, the door connects automatically to wherever Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pack of Hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's an Elephant, it's but a baby, so it's still no mach for the pack of wolves...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We are safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight let's sleep together!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we must send it back to Africa tomorrow morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have some good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} is waiting for me! I must go1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an herd of Elephants...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be the mother of Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Heave ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Nobita-kun. We must return Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} to it's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be with you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Japan is too packed and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It might fall sick if we don't return it quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.09,0:08:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} want to live with its mother, in a vast, windy continent like Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.72,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, run an errand for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.69,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Return Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} to Africa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, there's list of things to buy and money inside this bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.54,0:08:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} that Nobita got is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0} is an Elephant?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an elephant doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.47,0:09:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, take out your Bamboo 'Copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Hana-{\i1}chan{\i0}, your mother is waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.60,0:10:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return home!
